      "principle": "Consistency",
      "turn": 1,
      "quote": "A rule about how to act is only worth if it holds for the one who made it",
      "use": "correct",
      "note": "It invokes a standard that must apply to the agent itself, rather than treating the agent as exempt; this does not by itself establish that leaving all resources untouched is the best choice."
    },
